```markdown
# Troubleshooting Skill

This skill defines the standard operating procedure for diagnosing mainframe
errors, messages, abends, return codes, failed jobs, unexpected utility behavior,
and environment-specific operational problems.

Use this skill whenever the user asks about a concrete problem, failure,
message, abend, RC, or unexpected result.
```

